OL,3,GNEWSAExcitement grows for new ACOTAR
OL,4,Abook
OL,5,
OL,6,FFans of the book series A Court of
OL,7,FThorns and Roses are planning parties
OL,8,Fand taking days off work, ahead of a
OL,9,Fnew edition being released at 00:01 GMT
OL,10,Fon Tuesday.
OL,12,FDozens will be gathering at
OL,13,FWolverhampton Arts Centre on Monday
OL,14,Fnight, to celebrate the release of A
OL,15,FCourt of Splintered Harmony.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
