OL,3,GNEWSAExcitement grows for new ACOTAR
OL,4,Abook
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's the escapism, it's a way for
OL,7,Fpeople to escape from every day life.
OL,8,FSo many people, especially young women,
OL,9,Fsee themselves in these characters and
OL,10,Fthere are so many really strong
OL,11,Fmessages about empowerment and finding
OL,12,Fstrength," party organiser Holly
OL,13,FFellows, from Redditch, said.
OL,15,FThe fantasy series, written by American
OL,16,Fauthor, Sarah J. Maas, is popular with
OL,17,Freaders across the world.
